## Self-Cleaning Slicker Brush for Dogs & Cats – Easy Grooming with a Push of a Button

Groom like a pro and keep your brush clean with the Freshly Bailey Self-Cleaning Slicker Brush—the perfect combination of comfort, efficiency, and convenience. This grooming essential is ideal for short to medium-haired dogs and cats, removing loose hair, tangles, and mats without scratching or irritating your pet’s skin.

The fine, bent wire bristles are designed to reach deep into the undercoat while remaining gentle on the skin. Your pet will enjoy a soothing massage during each session, boosting circulation and promoting a healthier, shinier coat.

But the best part? Cleaning the brush is effortless. With one click, the bristles retract and the collected hair slides right off—no more picking fur out by hand. Plus, this feature protects the bristles from bending, helping your brush last longer and stay gentle on your pet.

Comfortable for you, relaxing for your furry friend—the Freshly Bailey slicker brush turns grooming into a positive bonding experience you’ll both enjoy.

### Frequently asked questions

How does the self-cleaning button work? Click the button and the bristles pull back, so the hair slides right off. It also keeps the bristles from bending.

Which dogs is it best for? It works best on dogs with short to medium coats.

My dog hates being brushed. Will this help? Yes. It's our top pick for dogs that are new to brushing or don't like it. It's gentle, so it helps them get used to being brushed.

Will it scratch my pet's skin? No. The fine, bent wire bristles reach the undercoat while staying gentle on skin. Use light strokes.

Is it good for doodles? It's a great starter brush for doodles that don't like being brushed. For thick, curly coats, our Slicker Brush for Goldendoodles reaches deeper.

What if it doesn't work for my pet? You're covered by our 30-Day Return Guarantee, even if you've used it. Email us within 30 days of delivery and send it back for a refund. Return shipping is paid by the customer. See our refund policy.

