Give your grooming routine a one-click refresh with the Safari Self-Cleaning Slicker Brush— engineered to lift loose hair, smooth tangles, and wipe clean at the push of a button.

Self-Cleaning Convenience 

Press the release button and the stainless-steel pins retract, dropping collected hair straight into the trash—no plucking fur from the pad.

Gentle, Effective Pins 

Flexible slicker pins glide through every coat type, breaking up mats and capturing undercoat without scratching sensitive skin.

Comfortable, Non-Slip Grip 

An ergonomic handle stays steady—even with wet or soapy hands—so long sessions never strain wrists.

Quick to Rinse & Reuse 

Rinse the pin pad if needed, shake off water, and air-dry; stainless steel won’t rust or dull.

Instructions 

- Work on a dry coat
- Starting at the neck, brush with the hair growth toward the tail using light strokes
- Press the button to retract pins and discard hair as needed
- Wipe pins clean and let air-dry before storage

Safety

Use gentle pressure; stop if skin reddens or your dog shows discomfort. Store the brush out of reach of pets and children.

Specifications

