FAQ

Does it work on curly or double coats?

Yes—the flexible pins penetrate dense, curly, and double coats to remove loose hair and dander.

How often should I use it?

Heavy shedders: 2–3 times a week. Light shedders: once weekly or as needed.

Will the pins rust after washing?

No—stainless steel resists rust. Rinse, shake off excess water, and air-dry.

